    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 251]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(History)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Our country’s history began about 5,000 years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The first country’s ancient name was Gojoson. A"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "fter it fell, the Korean peninsula was divided into three Kingdoms."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Later these three kingdoms united as a single nation called"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the Shilla Kingdom."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After Shilla fell, many other countries tried to control Korea."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "For a while, Korea was ruled by Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Our country was liberated from Japan in 1945."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The Korean Civil War in 1950 divided the Korean peninsula"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "into North and South Korea."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After the war, the country developed very quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We hosted the Summer Olympic Games in 1988"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and the World Cup in 2002."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I am proud of what my country has accomplished"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "during its long history."
    },
    {
